    "text": "By Carolynn Unger ,\n14 hours ago HARRISONBURG, VA (Rocktown Now) — Break out the rhinestones, pink, and your best Dolly-inspired look: the Rockingham Harrisonburg SPCA (RHSPCA) is joining Rootstock Wine Bar tonight, September 16, from 5-8 pm for Dolly Paw-ton Night, a playful community fundraiser benefiting local animals in need. The evening will celebrate all... Read full article\n2",
